hé ?"},{"bbox":{"b":301.07023644447327,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":372.934827208519,"r":521.1900713443756,"t":287.7361219525337},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":4,"end_row_offset_idx":3,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":3,"start_row_offset_idx":2,"text":"/circleright Définir des éléments de fidélisation"},{"bbox":{"b":360.0850145816803,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":115.03973560035229,"r":187.63355267047882,"t":332.19583010673523},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":2,"end_row_offset_idx":4,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":1,"start_row_offset_idx":3,"text":"Rémunération non motivante"},{"bbox":{"b":379.1204462349415,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":199.94400289654732,"r":364.1300662755966,"t":332.6517404615879},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":3,"end_row_offset_idx":4,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":2,"start_row_offset_idx":3,"text":"/boxcheckbld La rémunération intègre-t-elle une part variable ? /boxcheckbld La part variable est-elle plafonnée ?"},{"bbox":{"b":415.8518516421318,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":371.71063911914825,"r":547.303352355957,"t":334.9088518023491},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":4,"end_row_offset_idx":4,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":3,"start_row_offset_idx":3,"text":"/circleright Réexaminer au minimum annuellement la rémunération de chacun, à l'issue de l'entretien annuel d'évaluation /circleright Mettre en place des opérations d'intéressement ponctuelles (par exemple, des challenges pour les commerciaux) ou étalées dans l'année"},{"bbox":{"b":443.89794105291367,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":114.88167449831963,"r":165.2665728032589,"t":418.27817898988724},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":2,"end_row_offset_idx":5,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":1,"start_row_offset_idx":4,"text":"Clientélisme / favoritisme"},{"bbox":{"b":455.48361629247665,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":203.2969897389412,"r":329.7453209757805,"t":419.32744735479355},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":3,"end_row_offset_idx":5,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":2,"start_row_offset_idx":4,"text":"/boxcheckbld Le processus de fixation de la rémunération assure-t-il son objectivité ?"},{"bbox":{"b":461.6784226298332,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":372.4574256539345,"r":546.5148585438728,"t":419.17637515068054},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":4,"end_row_offset_idx":5,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":3,"start_row_offset_idx":4,"text":"/circleright Faire valider par le supérieur hiérarchique N+2 la variation de rémunération proposée par le supérieur hiérarchique N+1"},{"bbox":{"b":518.8616339564323,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":115.12873813509941,"r":193.62143650650978,"t":472.18499797582626},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":2,"end_row_offset_idx":6,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":1,"start_row_offset_idx":5,"text":"Non-conformité aux instructions internes en matière de rémunération"},{"bbox":{"b":517.9834293723106,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":202.36314728856087,"r":353.7117474079132,"t":472.6629257798195},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":3,"end_row_offset_idx":6,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":2,"start_row_offset_idx":5,"text":"/boxcheckbld La DRH communique-t-elle au manager les fourchettes applicables selon les catégories d'emploi et les métiers ?"},{"bbox":{"b":498.63136053085327,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":372.8337696194649,"r":547.7484032511711,"t":472.9464143514633},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":4,"end_row_offset_idx":6,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":3,"start_row_offset_idx":5,"text":"/circleright Faire communiquer par la DRH des grilles, règles et modalités à respecter"},{"bbox":{"b":585.6727707982063,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":114.67566072940826,"r":192.0741699039936,"t":521.2645413279533},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":2,"end_row_offset_idx":7,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":1,"start_row_offset_idx":6,"text":"Incohérence entre le niveau de rémunération et la situation du collaborateur"},{"bbox":{"b":591.2997094988823,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":200.05285766720772,"r":366.5287239551544,"t":523.2911261916161},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":3,"end_row_offset_idx":7,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":2,"start_row_offset_idx":6,"text":"/boxcheckbld Les rémunérations sont elles conformes aux termes du contrat de travail ? /boxcheckbld Les situations particulières (retour d'expatriation, ancienneté, intégration des salariés d'une nouvelle acquisition, etc.) sont-elles identifiées et gérées ?"},{"bbox":{"b":551.5697679519653,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":373.45607644319534,"r":541.6114403605461,"t":526.3814499378204},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":4,"end_row_offset_idx":7,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":3,"start_row_offset_idx":6,"text":"/circleright Mettre en place des Comités RH avec un reporting vers la direction générale"},{"bbox":{"b":640.6901686191559,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":41.30857155099511,"r":93.07064132392406,"t":602.8194437026978},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":1,"end_row_offset_idx":8,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":0,"start_row_offset_idx":7,"text":"Assurer la sécurité des données"},{"bbox":{"b":697.8672800660133,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":113.32722225785255,"r":194.30503529310226,"t":601.6441259980202},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":2,"end_row_offset_idx":8,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":1,"start_row_offset_idx":7,"text":"Fuite d'informations Accès frauduleux aux SIRH Modifications frauduleuses des données de la paie"},{"bbox":{"b":653.5127837061882,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":200.0029098391533,"r":358.38488882780075,"t":601.8248071074486},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":3,"end_row_offset_idx":8,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":2,"start_row_offset_idx":7,"text":"/boxcheckbld Des contrôles préventifs et détectifs permettant d'assurer la confidentialité des informations relatives à la rémunération sont-ils mis en place ?"},{"bbox":{"b":809.5323019623756,"coord_origin":"TOPLEFT","l":370.79995888471603,"r":547.4411637187004,"t":597.9182125926018},"col_span":1,"column_header":false,"end_col_offset_idx":4,"end_row_offset_idx":8,"fillable":false,"row_header":false,"row_section":false,"row_span":1,"start_col_offset_idx":3,"start_row_offset_idx":7,"text":"/circleright Faire signer un engagement de confidentialité pour les acteurs concernés (managers, RH, Informaticiens, etc.) /circleright Elaborer un Code de déontologie (y compris un code spécifique à la fonction RH le cas échéant) /circleright Définir des profils d'accès aux SIRH /circleright Mettre à jour ces profils d'accès (la DRH signale à la DSI les entrants et les sortants)  /circleright Contrôler annuellement les habilitations pour s'assurer qu'elles sont justifiées par des besoins métiers /circleright Faire réaliser une revue indépendante des journaux des accès et des transactions dans les SI RH se